    "target_status": "source_written",
    "target_text": "Gray(5) cells are walls. For every reachable black(0) cell, compare its shortest-path distance to the red(2) seed(2) and the green(3) seed(3). Color cells closer to the red(2) seed cyan(8), cells closer to the green(3) seed yellow(4), and leave ties black(0)."
